	(footprint "ModularLight:CornerJoint_R"
		(layer "F.Cu")
		(uuid "2775ea6c-0fa6-4bc1-a0c7-2fec336364ba")
		(at 140.95 84)
		(descr "Polygon corner joint at the right end of an edge board (edge at x=0, pads extend -x). SPEC V5.3: 5 SMD signal pads on the inward face (F.Cu) + 3 SMD power pads on the exterior face (B.Cu), all abutting the board end. Pad 1 D, 2 CANH, 3 CANL, 4 SENSE, 5 DRIVE (F.Cu, top to bottom); 7 +5V, 8 GND, 6 +12V (B.Cu, top to bottom; GND between the two supplies so a solder bead can never join +12V to +5V; 2.5 mm gaps). Mirror of CornerJoint_L.")
